title: permadeath
---
Someone places a contract before you.
You are too overwhelmed, so you just sign it without reading.
Suddenly...
A hand snatches the contract.
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Dr. iur. Dr. phil. Acula">>
    <<sprite "drac">>
    <<theme "drac">>
    It's surprisingly pale.
    {$charname}: Yes. YES!
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: Finally I can stop pretending.
    You: What?
    {$charname}: Oh, you really didn't suspect?
    {$charname}: A pity.
    {$charname}: I didn't think you were as dumb as you looked.
    You: Excuse me?
    {$charname}: Ugh.
    {$charname}: You just signed a contract to let me suck you dry.
    Looks like you should always read documents before signing them.
    {$charname}: Anyways...
    She gets out a handkerchief and ties it round her own neck.
    {$charname}: Your bloodtype is AB-?
    You: ...yes.
    {$charname}: Delicious.
    You: I cannot believe that I actually liked you...
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    <<sprite "witch">>
    <<theme "witch">>
    It's surprisingly green.
    {$charname}: Yes. YES!
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: Finally I can stop pretending.
    You: What?
    {$charname}: Oh, you really didn't suspect?
    {$charname}: Damn.
    {$charname}: Didn't think you were as stupid as you looked.
    You: Excuse me?
    {$charname}: Ugh.
    {$charname}: You just signed a contract to let me use your organs as ingredients for my potions.
    Looks like you should always read documents before signing them.
    {$charname}: Anyways...
    He pulls out his wand.
    {$charname}: Hold very still then this will only hurt a little.
    You: Really?
    {$charname}: No, it will hurt like hell.
    You: I cannot believe that I actually liked you...
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    <<sprite "moth">>
    <<theme "moth">>
    It's surprisingly fuzzy.
    {$charname}: Yes. YES!
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: Finally I can stop pretending.
    You: What?
    {$charname}: Oh, you really didn't suspect?
    {$charname}: Of kós.
    {$charname}: I don't know why I thought you would.
    You: Excuse me?
    {$charname}: Well.
    {$charname}: You just signed a contract to let me sacrifice you to the Great Lämp.
    Looks like you should always read documents before signing them.
    {$charname}: Anyways...
    They take out a rope and tie your hands.
    {$charname}: You will make a fine sacrifice.
    {$charname}: The Great Lämp will be pleased.
    You: I cannot believe that I actually liked you...
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    <<sprite "fish">>
    <<theme "fish">>
    It's surprisingly slimy.
    {$charname}: Yes. YES!
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: Finally I can stop pretending.
    You: What?
    {$charname}: Oh, you really didn't suspect?
    {$charname}: Oof.
    {$charname}: You really are gullible.
    You: Excuse me?
    {$charname}: Well.
    {$charname}: You just signed a contract to let me eat you.
    {$charname}: And I don't mean eating you out.
    {$charname}: I will actually eat you.
    Looks like you should always read documents before signing them.
    {$charname}: Well...
    He takes out a knife and fork.
    {$charname}: I would appreciate it if you kept the screaming to a minimum.
    You: I cannot believe that I actually liked you...
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    <<sprite "mum">>
    <<theme "mum">>
    It's surprisingly muscular.
    {$charname}: Yes. YES!
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: Finally I can stop pretending.
    You: What?
    {$charname}: Oh, you really didn't suspect?
    {$charname}: Hmm...
    {$charname}: I thought you were smarter than this.
    You: Excuse me?
    {$charname}: Hm. Look.
    {$charname}: You just signed a contract to let me grind your body into powder, so I can put it in my protein shakes.
    Looks like you should always read documents before signing them.
    {$charname}: Anyways...
    She pulls you close.
    {$charname}: I will break every bone in your body first.
    You: I cannot believe that I actually liked you...
<<endif>>
{$charname}: Well, looks like...
<<cam BaitCam>>
===